  "description": "Test build of Yasuo's Wind Wall (needs League of Legends Heroes): when enemy champions' missiles fly at Yasuo or an ally near him (two or more, or one at a low ally), he raises a bowed wall of rising wind in front of him for 4 seconds (every 20 seconds); a missile crossing it is stopped - the game cannot delete a missile, so the damage it then does to an ally is given back and its new crowd control cleared. The main pack's Yasuo has no Wind Wall. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
